t":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-03-28T18:27:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T09:00:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.4.1 - NVIDIA\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen creating a plugin with a slash in the name and the default plugin subfolder, a nested plugin folder will be created, with the \"plugin.cfg\" will be placed in the nested folder, which won't work and an error will be popped up by the editor.\n\nIt seems like the fix would simply be to replace the \"/\" with a \"_\" in addition to lowercasing the name to create the default folder.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nReproduction steps:\n* Go to Project > Project Settings > Plugins tab\n* Click \"Create New Plugin\"\n* Enter a Plugin Name with a slash (e.g., \"Import / Export\") (do not enter a folder name)\n* Click \"Create\"\n\nA plugin folder will be made named \"import\" that will have a folder named \"export\". The \"plugin.cfg\" will be put in the \"export\" folder, which doesn't work, and it will fail to create the plugin GD file.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny Project","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104732/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104732/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}